<title>UK: UK gilt auction -- full results.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction -- full results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2015</p>
<p>COUPON: 8.0 percent</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 7.86 percent</p>
<p>COVER: 2.66 times</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE: 101.11</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 98.0 percent</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY:</p>
<p>NOTES: The Bank of England sold 1.5 billion stg of the stock.</p>
</text>
